---

<BaseLayout
  title="网络工具箱：订阅体检、延迟模拟器、动态免费节点与美区苹果ID池 - 外网指南"
  description="完全在本地浏览器运行的轻量级网络工具箱：支持订阅链接与节点格式体检、三网跨国延迟测算，提供每日自动更新的开源动态免费订阅池与美区/港区公共 Apple ID 共享池。"
  ogType="website"
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
>
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 space-y-12">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="max-w-3xl space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-mint/10 border border-brand-mint/20 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-mint">
        <span>100% Local Privacy</span>
        <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-brand-mint"></span>
        <span>纯前端解析 · 免费应急全能工具箱</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-content-primary tracking-tight">
        网络工具箱：订阅体检、延迟测算与免费资源池
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-content-secondary leading-relaxed">
        诊断订阅有效性、识别节点协议、测算跨国专线延迟，获取每日开源动态订阅源与公共美区 Apple ID（已购小火箭）。
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Tool 01: Subscription & Node Inspector -->
    <section class="card-surface p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 space-y-6">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-brand-mint uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">TOOL 01</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-content-primary">
            🔍 订阅链接与节点格式体检器
          </h2>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs text-content-muted">支持 Clash、VLESS、Trojan、SS、VMess</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div>
          <label for="node-input" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-content-secondary mb-2">
            粘贴你的订阅链接或单节点链接（例如以 http://、vless://、trojan://、ss:// 开头）：
          </label>
          <textarea
            id="node-input"
            rows="3"
            class="w-full p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-bg-sub border border-white/10 text-xs font-mono text-content-primary focus:border-brand-mint focus:outline-none placeholder:text-content-muted/50"
            placeholder="例如：https://sub.example.com/api/v1/client/subscribe?token=... 或 vless://a1b2c3...@hk.node.com:443..."
          ></textarea>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <button
            id="inspect-btn"
            type="button"
            class="btn-primary text-xs !py-2.5 !px-5 font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5"
          >
            <span>开始格式体检</span>
            <span>⚡</span>
          </button>
          <button
            id="clear-input-btn"
            type="button"
            class="btn-secondary text-xs !py-2 !px-3 text-content-muted hover:text-content-primary"
          >
            清空
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Result Box -->
        <div id="inspect-result" class="hidden p-5 rounded-xl bg-bg-sub/80 border border-brand-mint/30 space-y-3 text-xs">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="font-bold text-sm text-content-primary">体检诊断报告：</span>
            <span id="format-badge" class="badge-mint text-[10px]">格式有效</span>
          </div>
          <div id="inspect-details" class="space-y-1.5 font-mono text-content-secondary">
            <!-- Dynamic Content -->
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Tool 02: ISP Latency Simulator -->
    <section class="card-surface p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 space-y-6">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-brand-blue uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">TOOL 02</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-content-primary">
            📡 三网跨国物理延迟模拟测算器
          </h2>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs text-content-muted">基于光纤物理折射与 BGP 调度模型</span>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <!-- Select ISP -->
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-content-secondary">1. 你的本地宽带运营商</label>
          <select id="sim-isp" class="w-full p-3 rounded-xl bg-bg-sub border border-white/10 text-xs text-content-primary focus:border-brand-mint focus:outline-none">
            <option value="telecom">中国电信 (163/CN2)</option>
            <option value="unicom">中国联通 (169/9929)</option>
            <option value="mobile">中国移动 (CMI)</option>
            <option value="cbn">中国广电 / 长城宽带</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <!-- Select Destination -->
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-content-secondary">2. 目标服务器所在地区</label>
          <select id="sim-dest" class="w-full p-3 rounded-xl bg-bg-sub border border-white/10 text-xs text-content-primary focus:border-brand-mint focus:outline-none">
            <option value="hk">🇭🇰 中国香港 (Hong Kong)</option>
            <option value="jp">🇯🇵 日本东京 (Tokyo)</option>
            <option value="sg">🇸🇬 新加坡 (Singapore)</option>
            <option value="tw">🇹🇼 中国台湾 (Taiwan)</option>
            <option value="us">🇺🇸 美国洛杉矶 (Los Angeles)</option>
            <option value="uk">🇬🇧 英国伦敦 (London)</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <!-- Select Line Type -->
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-content-secondary">3. 节点线路物理架构</label>
          <select id="sim-line" class="w-full p-3 rounded-xl bg-bg-sub border border-white/10 text-xs text-content-primary focus:border-brand-mint focus:outline-none">
            <option value="iepl">👑 IEPL/IPLC 企业内网专线 (不过公网GFW)</option>
            <option value="bgp">⚡ BGP 优质机房隧道中转</option>
            <option value="direct">🌐 普通公网直连 (163 骨干直出)</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Latency Output Card -->
      <div class="card-surface-sub p-5 rounded-xl border border-brand-mint/30 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-mint/[0.04] to-transparent flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <span class="text-[11px] text-content-muted uppercase font-mono">预估物理往返延迟 (RTT)</span>
          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
            <span id="calc-ping" class="text-3xl font-black font-mono text-brand-mint">25-35</span>
            <span class="text-sm font-mono text-content-muted">ms (毫秒)</span>
          </div>
          <p id="calc-advice" class="text-xs text-content-secondary">
            晚高峰丢包率预计 &lt; 0.1%，完美支持 YouTube 4K 零缓冲与外服电竞联机。
          </p>
        </div>

        <a
          id="calc-recommend-link"
          href="/recommend/"
          class="btn-primary text-xs !py-2.5 !px-5 font-bold whitespace-nowrap shadow-md"
        >
          查看推荐适配服务商 ↗
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Tool 03: Dynamic Open-Source Free Subscription Pool -->
    <section class="card-surface p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-brand-mint/30 bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-mint/[0.02] to-transparent space-y-8">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-brand-mint uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">TOOL 03 · 极客专区</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-content-primary flex items-center gap-2">
            <span>🎁 每日自动轮换 · 开源动态公益订阅池</span>
          </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-mint animate-pulse"></span>
          <span class="text-xs text-brand-mint font-mono font-semibold">GitHub 聚合探针每 6 小时同步</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 1. Dynamic Aggregated Subscription URLs -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-content-primary flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>🔗 1. 全平台动态通用订阅源 (复制直接导入客户端)</span>
        </h3>

        <div class="space-y-3">
          {dynamicSubscriptions.map((sub) => (
            <div class="card-surface p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 hover:border-brand-mint/30 transition-colors">
              <div class="space-y-1">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="font-bold text-xs text-content-primary">{sub.name}</span>
                  <span class="badge-mint text-[10px] font-mono">{sub.format}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-[11px] text-content-muted">
                  <span>支持软件：<strong class="text-content-secondary">{sub.client}</strong></span>
                  <span>频率：<strong class="text-brand-mint">{sub.updateFreq}</strong></span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <button
                  type="button"
                  data-promo-code={sub.url}
                  data-brand={sub.name}
                  class="copy-free-node-btn btn-primary text-xs !py-2 !px-4 font-bold whitespace-nowrap flex items-center gap-1.5"
                >
                  <span>📋 一键复制订阅 URL</span>
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. Single Emergency Sample Nodes -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-content-primary flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>⚡ 2. 独立单节点快速提取 (单节点应急直连)</span>
        </h3>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          {freeNodes.map((node) => (
            <div class="card-surface p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 space-y-3 hover:border-brand-mint/30 transition-colors">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="font-bold text-xs text-content-primary">{node.name}</span>
                <span class="badge-mint text-[10px] font-mono">{node.protocol}</span>
              </div>

              <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-content-muted pt-1 border-t border-white/5">
                <span>地区：<strong class="text-content-primary">{node.region}</strong></span>
                <span>带宽：<strong class="text-brand-mint">{node.speed}</strong></span>
                <span>用途：<strong class="text-content-secondary">{node.traffic}</strong></span>
              </div>

              <div class="pt-1 flex items-center gap-2">
                <button
                  type="button"
                  data-promo-code={node.link}
                  data-brand={node.name}
                  class="copy-free-node-btn flex-1 btn-secondary text-xs !py-1.5 font-mono flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5"
                >
                  <span>📋 一键复制单节点代码</span>
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Tool 04: Public Apple ID Shared Pool & Shadowrocket Download -->
    <section class="card-surface p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-brand-mint/40 bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-mint/[0.03] to-transparent space-y-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-brand-mint uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">TOOL 04 · iOS 苹果专区</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-content-primary flex items-center gap-2">
            <span>🍎 每日美区/港区 Apple ID 共享池（已购小火箭）</span>
          </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
          <span class="text-xs text-emerald-400 font-mono font-semibold">账号状态探针监控中</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CRITICAL SAFETY RED LINE -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-rose-500/15 border border-rose-500/30 text-xs text-rose-300 leading-relaxed space-y-2">
        <div class="font-extrabold text-sm flex items-center gap-2 text-rose-200">
          <span>🚫 致命安全红线：严禁在手机「系统设置 (iCloud)」中登录公共账号！</span>
        </div>
        <p>
          1. <strong>只允许在【App Store (应用商店)】右上角头像处登录</strong>！在系统设置中登录会导致您的 iPhone 照片被同步或锁机变砖！<br />
          2. 登录时若弹出<strong>「Apple ID 安全 / 双重认证」</strong>，必须点击底部的<strong>【其他选项】➔【不升级】</strong>，切勿绑定自己的手机号！<br />
          3. 下载完小火箭（Shadowrocket）后，请立即在 App Store 中退出公共账号并换回自己的日常 Apple ID。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Shared Apple ID Cards -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        {sharedAppleIDs.map((id) => (
          <div class="card-surface p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 space-y-3 hover:border-brand-mint/40 transition-colors">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="font-bold text-xs text-content-primary">{id.region}</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-brand-mint">{id.status}</span>
            </div>

            <p class="text-[11px] text-content-secondary leading-relaxed h-10 overflow-hidden">
              {id.desc}
            </p>

            <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-bg-sub border border-white/5 space-y-1.5 font-mono text-xs">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="text-content-muted text-[10px]">账号:</span>
                <span class="text-content-primary font-bold truncate max-w-[170px] select-all">{id.email}</span>
                <button
                  type="button"
                  data-promo-code={id.email}
                  data-brand={id.region}
                  class="copy-free-node-btn text-[10px] text-brand-mint hover:underline font-sans"
                >
                  复制
                </button>
              </div>

              <div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-1 border-t border-white/5">
                <span class="text-content-muted text-[10px]">密码:</span>
                <span class="text-brand-mint font-bold select-all">{id.pass}</span>
                <button
                  type="button"
                  data-promo-code={id.pass}
