            </strong>
            <span class="badge-mint text-[9px]">100%成功 · 免折腾</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-content-secondary text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
            不想反复排队试公共账号？我们的主推机场（<strong>光速云</strong>、<strong>星岛梦</strong>）后台已内置免美区 ID 的客户端直装与配置服务，注册即可一键在 iOS 开启 IEPL 专线：
          </p>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-1">
            <a
              href="https://sahude.gsyvipaff.com/#/?code=keqgvT5Y"
              target="_blank"
              rel="nofollow sponsored noopener"
              class="btn-primary text-[11px] !py-1 !px-3 font-bold"
            >
              🥇 光速云免 ID 直通车 ↗
            </a>
            <a
              href="https://guangs.xingdaomeng.com/#/?code=1TynBYnR"
              target="_blank"
              rel="nofollow sponsored noopener"
              class="btn-secondary text-[11px] !py-1 !px-3 font-bold"
            >
              🥈 星岛梦免 ID 专区 ↗
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-bg-sub/80 border border-white/5 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-2 text-xs">
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <strong class="text-content-primary flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span>💡 3分钟自己注册永久美区 ID（终身不求人）</span>
            </strong>
            <p class="text-content-secondary text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
              只需国内常用邮箱与普通 +86 手机号，免外币信用卡即可自己注册一个 100% 独享的美区 Apple ID，再也不用担心公共号被锁或排队。
            </p>
          </div>
          <a href="/clients/iphone/" class="btn-secondary text-xs !py-2 !px-3 text-center font-bold block hover:border-brand-mint">
            查看小白自建美区 ID 图文教程 ↗
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Top 4 Verified Providers Free Trial & Promo Channel -->
    <section class="card-surface p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-content-primary flex items-center gap-2">
            <span>🌟 2026 编辑部核心 4 大主推专线 · 免费试用与专属折扣通道</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-content-secondary mt-0.5">
            IEPL 企业级内网专线，晚高峰 0 丢包，原生支持 ChatGPT 4o 与 4K 超清满速：
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3.5">
        {trialProviders.map((tp) => (
          <div class="card-surface p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 hover:border-brand-mint/40 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between space-y-3">
            <div class="space-y-1.5">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-brand-mint/10 text-brand-mint border border-brand-mint/20">{tp.badge}</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-brand-blue font-mono font-semibold">{tp.discount}</span>
              </div>
              <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-content-primary">{tp.name}</h4>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-content-secondary">{tp.tag}</p>
              <div class="text-[10px] text-brand-mint font-mono bg-bg-sub px-2 py-1 rounded border border-white/5">
                🎁 {tp.trial}
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="pt-2 border-t border-white/5 space-y-2">
              <div
                data-promo-code={tp.promo}
                data-brand={tp.name}
                data-url={tp.url}
                class="cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] bg-bg-sub/80 hover:bg-bg-sub p-1.5 rounded-lg border border-white/5 group"
                title="点击复制优惠码"
              >
                <span class="text-content-muted text-[10px]">优惠码:</span>
                <strong class="font-mono text-brand-mint group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">{tp.promo}</strong>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-content-muted">复制 📋</span>
              </div>

              <a
                href={tp.url}
                target="_blank"
                rel="nofollow sponsored noopener"
                class="btn-primary w-full text-center text-xs !py-1.5 font-bold block"
              >
                官网开通试用 ↗
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
